# Mystery Box Game

## 🎮 Game Description

"Mystery Box" is a simple text-based adventure game where the player is a treasure hunter trying to guess the correct 3-digit code to open a mysterious box. The player has 5 attempts to guess the code, and after each guess, they receive feedback indicating whether their guess was too low, too high, or correct.

## 🕹️ How to Play

1. Run the game using Python.
2. You will be prompted to enter a 3-digit number as your guess.
